            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=4",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "女工奉事太祖昭后恭謹不倦后不能及故不為舅姑"
          },
          {
            "column": "4R09",
            "pdf_page": 4,
            "half": "右",
            "leaf": "2下",
            "column_from_right": 9,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=4",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "所重世祖家好亦薄焉性剛嚴竟陵王子良妃袁氏布"
          },
          {
            "column": "4R10",
            "pdf_page": 4,
            "half": "右",
            "leaf": "2下",
            "column_from_right": 10,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=4",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "衣時有過后加訓罰昇明三年為齊世子妃建元元年"
          },
          {
            "column": "4L01",
            "pdf_page": 4,
            "half": "左",
            "leaf": "3上",
            "column_from_right": 1,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=4",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "為皇太子妃三年后薨諡穆妃葬休安陵世祖即位追"
          },
          {
            "column": "4L02",
            "pdf_page": 4,
            "half": "左",
            "leaf": "3上",
            "column_from_right": 2,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=4",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "尊皇后贈璣之金紫光祿大夫后母檀氏餘杭廣昌鄉"
          },
          {
            "column": "4L03",
            "pdf_page": 4,
            "half": "左",
            "leaf": "3上",
            "column_from_right": 3,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=4",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 2,
            "text": "元君"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-020-peihuizhao-wyd:p003",
      "text": "舊顯陽昭陽殿太后皇后所居也永明中無太后皇后羊貴嬪居昭陽殿西范貴妃居昭陽殿東寵姬荀昭華居鳳華栢殿宮內御所居壽昌畫殿南閣置白鷺鼓吹二部乾光殿東西頭置鍾磬兩廂皆宴樂處也上數遊幸諸苑囿載宮人從後車宮內深隱不聞端門鼓漏聲置鍾於景陽樓上宮人聞鍾聲早起裝飾至今此鍾唯應五鼓及三鼓也車駕數幸琅邪城宮人常從早發至湖北埭鷄始鳴",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "reviewed",
